message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file, together with the publications of the
  phase-formation models and data sources listed in the README, and the original HEACalculator.
type: software
title: HEA Calculator
abstract: >-
  A desktop application for calculating the thermodynamic and atomic-size parameters of high-entropy alloys and
  evaluating eight published solid-solution formation criteria.
